        "original_id": "95039c45-cec5-59ae-a479-d9d64411f140",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kool Kojak, Danny DeVito, Ed Helms, Zac Efron, Victoria Justice, Savan Kotecha, Mehrdad Raissi Ardali\n- Works: The Lorax, Best Friend's Brother, Victorious, The Lorax soundtrack, Shrek, Madagascar, Bolt, Up, Tangled, Over the Hedge, Cars 2, Kung Fu Panda, Happy Feet 2, Curious George, A Monster in Paris, Bee Movie, Rise of the Guardians, The Croods, Frozen\n- Topics: Music production, songwriting, film casting, Persian dubbing\n\nFacts:\n- Kool Kojak has written and produced music for artists including Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse and Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, N.A.S.A., Dirt Nasty, Lordz of Brooklyn, Ursula 1000, and Warren G.\n- Kool Kojak has also written and produced for Dr. Seuss's The Lorax.\n- The 2011 song \"Best Friend's Brother\" was produced by Kool Kojak.\n- Kool Kojak co-wrote \"Best Friend's Brother\" with Savan Kotecha and Victoria Justice for the 2011 soundtrack to the Nickelodeon television series Victorious.\n- The cast of The Lorax includes Danny DeVito as the Lorax, Ed Helms as the Once-ler, and Zac Efron as Ted.\n- Mehrdad Raissi Ardali provided the Persian voice of the Once-ler in The Lorax.\n- Mehrdad Raissi Ardali has also provided Persian voices for animation characters including Donkey in Shrek, Marty in Madagascar, Buck, Bolt in Bolt, Carl Fredricksen in Up, Flynn Rider in Tangled, RJ in Over the Hedge, Francesco Bernoulli in Cars 2, Mr. Ping in Kung Fu Panda, Ramon in Happy Feet 2, the Man in the Yellow Hat in Curious George, Raoul in A Monster in Paris, Barry in Bee Movie, Bunnymund in Rise of the Guardians, Guy in The Croods, and Kristoff in Frozen.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
